msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Closes what Kodi's public interfaces cannot for Kofin's API build"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "Reads the requests Kofin's API build publishes and writes to Kodi's databases what no public interface can: a movie's versions grouped, the server's chapter images in the native chapters dialog, and the rest of the parity ledger. Optional: Kofin works without it and reports which gaps it leaves open."
msgstr ""

